{"parse": {"title": "十月无晴天-08", "pageid": 88959, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-07\" title=\"十月无晴天-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">十月无晴天-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-10\" title=\"十月无晴天-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">十月无晴天</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AF.8D.E4.BA.B2.E5.95.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"母亲啊\">母亲啊</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 母亲啊</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">O, Mother</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十年后</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烈火无法，将过去化为尘埃，直到现在</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到现在</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到现在</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到现在</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>这个唱片卡壳了，她老重复最后这句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>别拍了，你拍烂这留声机，她也不会跳出来给你唱一首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>她在留声机里头唱和外头唱有什么两样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>老东西，我看你脑子是坏掉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……大家，收拾收拾，准备出发了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gongmu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gongmu\"><img alt=\"gongmu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/600px-Cg-gongmu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/900px-Cg-gongmu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/1200px-Cg-gongmu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一队穿着黑衣的老人向着墓地缓缓前行，老金达站在队伍的最前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们一个个经过，用手抵着腰缓缓下弯，将手中的花束放在静土上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>“老煤渣”……老若热……老奥塔利娅……老多斯……老巴斯托斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>百合铺满墓土，亡魂等待歌唱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达领唱。正如上校说的，一个好的小提琴手兼颂歌领唱，不可多得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>她的声音怎么哑了，我甚至感觉她有点走音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>嘘——小声点。不管怎么说，她都领唱这么久了。——不过我听说，在此之前不是她领唱的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>之前领唱的人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅲ：</div><div>嘘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前面的老人回头，皱着眉禁止他们继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，语言也有其自己的禁区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>你是说娜娜……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>那个人叫娜娜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>噢噢，我听说过，据说她很早就来了，那时候这儿才刚建起来不久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>她是坐着一个竹篓顺水流而下，在咱们这儿被捡到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>不是，我听说她有一对翅膀，就跟天使一样，是从天空上飞下来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅳ：</div><div>天哪，那不是天使的翅膀，那是恶魔的翅膀！我听说她是一个通缉犯，知道吗？悬赏金额高达数亿，你都无法想象——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>天哪，她做了什么事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅳ：</div><div>你知道那个女明星莉莉·兰多礼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅳ：</div><div>据说娜娜暗杀了她，一直被政府通缉，才躲到这儿来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>胡说，暗杀兰多礼的早就搜查出来了，不是她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>我听说她是头号间谍，将这儿的情报卖给那儿，将那儿的情报卖到这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>——肃静！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达靠近低头窃语的三两老人，她看上去比十年前更苍老。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你们在聊什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>嘿，呃，老金达，我们听说之前领唱的是一个小护士，我们在聊她呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>对啊，你在这个福利院呆的时间最长，你一定见过她。跟我们聊聊呗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你们说娜娜……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>对，她是谁，是什么来历？来吧，老金达，你一定知道些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达停顿了片刻后，轻轻地松一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尝试反刍并不容易，欢声笑语如热带枝叶一般生长，遮蔽了年老回望的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是意识的尽头，最纯净的等待如初。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……她是最懂我们的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人继续作问。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><span style=\"color:#717171\"><span style=\"font-size:125%\">金达……</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达猛地回过头，看向天空。似有天使般的歌声从空中飘渺而降。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更多的答案如这个城市的阵痛一般，在每一个牲畜与轮渡欣欣向荣的早上散发着阵阵玫瑰色的光泽。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我的老天，到底是为什么，我前天刚去市场买的鸡，今天就统统消失了！这已经是当月第三次了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">护工：</div><div>别急，金达，大概是谁家养的癞皮狗来偷咱的鸡吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>瞧着吧，我今晚必须弄清楚这是怎么回事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">护工：</div><div>你小心别被黄鼠狼咬到，那家伙一次能生吞一整只鸡，不会留下一丁点血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>放心吧，奥塔利娅，我家以前也闹过黄鼠狼灾，我花了一个星期就把它抓到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504702.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504702.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-504702.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504702.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">护工：</div><div>那你就试试吧，大伙都等着尝你的炖鸡呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜色已深，老金达未眠，她等待着鸡棚里的动静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>终于，第一只鸡的嘶叫将她火速带往鸡棚。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_duanjiancheku\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_duanjiancheku.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达提着灯，在浓墨般的夜色中寻找着动静的来源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循着昏暗的灯光，她看到一个蓬头垢面的女孩，嘴里还叼着一只鸡爪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>所以你就是那头半夜偷鸡吃的黄鼠狼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血从女孩的嘴里流出来，老金达不能确定那是鸡的血还是她的血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩二话不说将鸡爪扯出来，表情显得有些疼痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……噢，天哪，天哪，别这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下一个动作，女孩伸出利爪，一把将老金达抵到墙边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……呼、呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/HeadIconSmall-310020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>你也是来抓我的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>噢——噢——别这样，我的宝贝，别怕，我不是来抓你的，我只是想弄明白鸡的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩怀疑地盯着老金达的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你瞧，我手无寸铁，年纪也大了，我根本抓不了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>相信我，我真的只是想来确认一下鸡。事实上，在此之前，我一直以为你是一只小狗或者一只小狼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的手松开，她快速后退到角落里，偷偷将剩下的一点鸡藏到怀中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看老金达并未有更多动作，她抱着鸡又开始狼吞虎咽起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达缓缓走过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……嘿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出手，想要去抚摸一下女孩的头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩突然颤抖了一下，扭头冲老金达支起了虎牙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……嘶——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达停下动作，手悬在半空中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后，似乎下定了什么决心似的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达继续伸手，摸上了女孩的头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩跳起来，一口咬住老金达的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血从牙印中流出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……嘶，呼……还挺疼的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达眯着眼睛忍受着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她发现牙印的疼痛在一点点减缓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，女孩松口了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达又揉了揉女孩的头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……吃吧，多吃一点，你看上去饿坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩瞪着眼睛看着老金达，而后低下头快速地把鸡都吃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达蹲下，用手将女孩的脸擦干净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>用手吃饭是不体面的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>看上去，在体面这条路上，你要学的还很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达给女孩递出一条手帕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>怎么样，要不要跟我来？新来的护士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的眼睛紧紧盯着老金达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，她抽了抽鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……这儿，会比其他地方更暖和吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "十月无晴天-08"}}